# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Framework: publish only the lacunae parameter script.
#
# The morphometric extraction backend (ifb_framework) is a third-party software
# that is now a product and cannot be redistributed, so the whole package is
# excluded. lacune_parameters_blocks_nii.py is published
# so the parameter definitions are inspectable, but note that it imports
# ifb_framework at module level and therefore will not run without it.
#
# The directory is excluded as `dir/*` rather than `dir/`, because git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
multiagent/framework/*
!multiagent/framework/lacune_parameters_blocks_nii.py
